{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-steam-wars/1538168-what-s-this","id":1538168,"title":"What's This?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Steam Wars"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-06T06:45:12-07:00","id":1538168,"title":"What's This?","content":"Is it alternative Victorian periods with Steampunk tech. A tech book resource for both <b>AETHER </b>and <b>ADVENTURE!</b> Or something far stranger. (Which is I assume we'd all root for.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-06T07:53:55-07:00","id":1538171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-steam-wars/1538168-what-s-this#post1538168\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it alternative Victorian periods with Steampunk tech. A tech book resource for both <b>AETHER </b>and <b>ADVENTURE!</b> Or something far stranger. (Which is I assume we'd all root for.)</div> </div> </div> </div>NO, it's alternative, Tangent 'alternative' setting ( see <b>TC Player's Guide</b> more about those ) to whole <b>Trinity</b>, based off Larry Blamire\u2019s decade old <b><i>Steam Wars</i></b> project - <b><a href=\"https://steamwars.com\" target=\"_blank\">here is his page about it</a> </b>- Basically, it's 'Battletech in circa War World 1 times, based on steam tech'. It will have proper mecha genere rules in it. And book will use <b>Storypath Ultra</b> rules, first in <b>Trinity</b> line at all. ( Yes, we do not know HOW it will be implemented - but seeing like <b>Storypath Ultra Manual</b> should have crowdfunding in August 2024, it will probably just need that book, not <b>TC Core</b> - but it's just fan guessing on my part. )<br /> <br /> <b>Aether</b> and <b>Adventure</b> are 'canon' settings in <b>TC</b>, <b>Steam Wars</b> will be sorta spin-off setting to it. Even if it's all timey-whimy already in whole <b>Continuum</b>.<br /> <br /> It was all said in detailed on <b>Trinity Continuum</b> Onyx Path Con 2024 Panel - it will be put on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@TheOnyxPath/videos\" target=\"_blank\"><b>OPP YouTube channel</b></a> in litoral days, as they putted almost all of rest of panels already.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-06-2024, 11:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-21T04:40:10-08:00","id":1547870,"title":"","content":"Steam Wars does seem interesting, but for me at least I\u2019m not sure it\u2019s enough to back the Kickstarter. I may wait and buy it when it comes out in a couple years.<br /> <br /> Feel free to try and convince me otherwise if anyone has any good arguments why it is worth investing in the Kickstarter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":26996,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","user":"Amethyst","date":". 01-21-2025, 10:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-21T08:30:56-08:00","id":1547877,"title":"","content":"On second thought, I changed my mind. I really am curious about Steam Wars, and I don\u2019t want to wait two years to learn about it, so I am going to back the Kickstarter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}